{"publication":{"id":"32c02fe6-e003-43f4-859b-a8c5b4a8f046","revisionSha256":"d273770ee7fd522e1ef22b0d3a22d754fac8d56417815ce38c5fc9c028b90f93","publishedAt":"2026-10-26T04:56:25.876Z","status":"published"},"exhibition":{"id":"034b4698-be09-420b-8602-b10a47e25324","kind":"exhibition-revision","rooms":[{"id":"8db67977-b6b5-4934-8b97-bfeef918c4e4","name":"입구","transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[0,0,0],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"dimensions":{"depth":4,"width":4,"height":4}},{"id":"c4bad805-9924-48d3-9357-1abb83fc69eb","name":"회화실","transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[0,0,-7],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"dimensions":{"depth":10,"width":8,"height":4}},{"id":"8946cd82-8a9c-4b9e-ad54-d1170f3413e4","name":"전이 공간","transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[6,0,-7],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"dimensions":{"depth":10,"width":4,"height":4}},{"id":"42587224-9481-4c4e-ab81-2a7d1b09d052","name":"조각실","transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[13,0,-7],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"dimensions":{"depth":10,"width":10,"height":4}},{"id":"0e6cbb52-a964-4515-8eff-1b7cebb8ae44","name":"마무리와 돌아가는 길","transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[7.5,0,0],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"dimensions":{"depth":4,"width":11,"height":4}}],"title":"표면과 입체를 보는 경험","units":"meter","lights":[{"id":"75723731-a10a-4acb-9833-5a45e227b365","type":"directional","unit":"lux","color":[1,1,1],"roomId":"42587224-9481-4c4e-ab81-2a7d1b09d052","intensity":2,"transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[1.2,1.8,1.5],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"castsShadow":false},{"id":"ee0a74c6-5954-42b5-8baa-44d29893efdf","type":"spot","unit":"candela","color":[1,0.6172065624196511,0.38132601143253014],"roomId":"c4bad805-9924-48d3-9357-1abb83fc69eb","beamAngle":1.0471975511965976,"intensity":14,"transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[-2.2,3.86,-4],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"castsShadow":false,"targetPlacementId":"e4af3c75-7fbc-4f5e-9d06-cd65deec807e"}],"scripts":[],"artworks":[{"id":"510f3e96-5d84-4963-a3b4-6ae88528215a","kind":"artwork","units":"meter","assets":[{"id":"fe7ef462-778e-4135-a12f-f28a34bcda64","mime":"image/png","path":"assets/fe7ef462-778e-4135-a12f-f28a34bcda64/image.png","role":"image","bytes":7503560,"sha256":"2d202bfa522a54dd6e0a73063ff2eabdb7f90aae246ba9322d6505019c5bda9f"},{"id":"d2e93784-d480-462e-834a-115cc5a540df","mime":"image/png","path":"assets/d2e93784-d480-462e-834a-115cc5a540df/image.png","role":"image","bytes":633155,"sha256":"e246eae77c461d0c3aed5949fe24ff1805f175e44aacf1752f2143cd2b9fbc0b"}],"rights":{"holder":"The Metropolitan Museum of Art, New York","licenseId":"CC0-1.0","ownership":"authorized-licensee","creditLine":"Vincent van Gogh · Wheat Field with Cypresses · 1889 · The Metropolitan Museum of Art, New York","permissions":{"export":true,"display":true,"download":true,"commercial":true}},"metadata":{"title":"Wheat Field with Cypresses","artist":"Vincent van Gogh","medium":"Oil on canvas","language":"ko","description":"빈센트 반 고흐 · Wheat Field with Cypresses · 1889 · 캔버스에 유채 · 73.2 × 93.4 cm · 메트로폴리탄 미술관, 1993.132\n\n밀밭과 하늘을 이루는 붓질의 방향을 따라가 보세요. 아래쪽의 짧고 비스듬한 선과 위쪽의 크게 굽이치는 선이 화면의 서로 다른 움직임을 만듭니다.\n\n가로 화면 아래에는 노란 밀밭이 펼쳐지고, 가운데에는 녹색 관목과 푸른 산이 보입니다. 오른쪽의 짙은 녹색 나무가 높게 솟아 있습니다. 위쪽 하늘에는 흰 구름과 푸른색·청록색의 굽은 붓자국이 이어집니다."},"revision":1,"createdAt":"2026-10-24T15:50:13.816Z","transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[0,0,0],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"dimensions":{"width":0.934,"height":0.732},"extensions":{"org.exhibitos.viewer/lod":{"version":1,"variants":[{"detail":"full","assetId":"fe7ef462-778e-4135-a12f-f28a34bcda64","textureSize":1792},{"detail":"coarse","assetId":"d2e93784-d480-462e-834a-115cc5a540df","textureSize":512}]},"org.exhibitos.viewer/display-policy":{"profile":"approved-open-access-demo-v1","version":1,"approvalId":"9e57417c-72a7-557e-af97-2935ef654733","sourceAssetSha256":"2d202bfa522a54dd6e0a73063ff2eabdb7f90aae246ba9322d6505019c5bda9f","rightsEvidenceSha256":"8c89d1cc6dc07d25e11f8ba084472a3aa8db2fce882dfa78970a034156d3e215"}},"provenance":{"events":[{"at":"2026-10-26T04:56:25.876Z","id":"4f864c0d-32b2-4ce0-9238-1d07090ab633","type":"exhibited","description":"Approved exact selected open-access display. Object https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/436535; raw SHA256 b46d02a42fd3bb13b022cefc5beaa997b1d7a28cd7b53e4413d940aa0dc4014d; canonical SHA256 2d202bfa522a54dd6e0a73063ff2eabdb7f90aae246ba9322d6505019c5bda9f; recipe SHA256 fe002ad256885d6c1899025aa2a07910faaf6eca9055bd87880a2b3b43a8ef24; rights evidence SHA256 8c89d1cc6dc07d25e11f8ba084472a3aa8db2fce882dfa78970a034156d3e215."}],"authorship":"human-authored"},"revisionId":"913f61bc-8b14-4a11-b496-e89ba9879d79","artworkType":"image","coordinates":"right-handed-y-up","schemaVersion":"1.0.0-draft.1","primaryAssetId":"fe7ef462-778e-4135-a12f-f28a34bcda64"},{"id":"4415b1f2-c421-42c7-84d1-7bc07a3ed78d","kind":"artwork","units":"meter","assets":[{"id":"4a18897c-c5cc-4776-8585-6a161401b26d","mime":"image/png","path":"assets/4a18897c-c5cc-4776-8585-6a161401b26d/image.png","role":"image","bytes":6702081,"sha256":"ca8e86fdb6e87880fc00d3db5fe89a1edef385183f2c6a64686d0f62ec6fcc57"},{"id":"fe8775b7-08d2-4722-91f7-0da7adf15ca6","mime":"image/png","path":"assets/fe8775b7-08d2-4722-91f7-0da7adf15ca6/image.png","role":"image","bytes":465262,"sha256":"d5f848d007d06ad5c275df3a7a4b018c89cf5a91202e3b61bc592d046cf64aeb"}],"rights":{"holder":"The Metropolitan Museum of Art, New York","licenseId":"CC0-1.0","ownership":"authorized-licensee","creditLine":"Rembrandt (Rembrandt van Rijn) · Aristotle with a Bust of Homer · 1653 · The Metropolitan Museum of Art, New York","permissions":{"export":true,"display":true,"download":true,"commercial":true}},"metadata":{"title":"Aristotle with a Bust of Homer","artist":"Rembrandt (Rembrandt van Rijn)","medium":"Oil on canvas","language":"ko","description":"렘브란트 판 레인 · Aristotle with a Bust of Homer · 1653 · 캔버스에 유채 · 143.5 × 136.5 cm · 메트로폴리탄 미술관, 61.198\n\n밝게 드러난 손과 소매, 흉상을 차례로 살펴보세요. 한 화면에서 그려진 석상과 옷감, 금속 사슬이 서로 다른 표면으로 보이는 방식을 비교할 수 있습니다.\n\n어두운 배경 앞에 검은 모자와 밝고 넓은 소매의 옷을 입은 남자가 서 있습니다. 화면 왼쪽의 밝은 흉상 머리 위에 한 손을 얹고, 다른 손은 허리 가까이에 둡니다. 금빛 사슬이 가슴과 허리를 가로지릅니다."},"revision":1,"createdAt":"2026-10-24T15:50:13.816Z","transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[0,0,0],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"dimensions":{"width":1.365,"height":1.435},"extensions":{"org.exhibitos.viewer/lod":{"version":1,"variants":[{"detail":"full","assetId":"4a18897c-c5cc-4776-8585-6a161401b26d","textureSize":2048},{"detail":"coarse","assetId":"fe8775b7-08d2-4722-91f7-0da7adf15ca6","textureSize":512}]},"org.exhibitos.viewer/display-policy":{"profile":"approved-open-access-demo-v1","version":1,"approvalId":"060cc086-7761-56c9-a5b6-6a9195b46185","sourceAssetSha256":"ca8e86fdb6e87880fc00d3db5fe89a1edef385183f2c6a64686d0f62ec6fcc57","rightsEvidenceSha256":"2f8e68a3c964e1529002e715e98943ad291dbdda3a05c858bedf324298eeb0e4"}},"provenance":{"events":[{"at":"2026-10-26T04:56:25.876Z","id":"6e9f3dde-4afc-4d63-ab0e-f380b5bfaae4","type":"exhibited","description":"Approved exact selected open-access display. Object https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/437394; raw SHA256 55dc9232dd6b412cea4964f19e98a56f6bd1fa7213e4e947834413cf65d8776a; canonical SHA256 ca8e86fdb6e87880fc00d3db5fe89a1edef385183f2c6a64686d0f62ec6fcc57; recipe SHA256 f0ba2331459a80b578d6d91a74c545c9e230c13dd3b2d808a438e31275538c04; rights evidence SHA256 2f8e68a3c964e1529002e715e98943ad291dbdda3a05c858bedf324298eeb0e4."}],"authorship":"human-authored"},"revisionId":"7f662e34-31d7-436a-a1f9-5edae7dd52ce","artworkType":"image","coordinates":"right-handed-y-up","schemaVersion":"1.0.0-draft.1","primaryAssetId":"4a18897c-c5cc-4776-8585-6a161401b26d"},{"id":"26d2b079-4b1e-4fa1-8fc4-60733e09e987","kind":"artwork","units":"meter","assets":[{"id":"2cce9da2-fcf7-43dd-888c-021da39f8b20","mime":"image/png","path":"assets/2cce9da2-fcf7-43dd-888c-021da39f8b20/image.png","role":"image","bytes":7948187,"sha256":"1b58a2eb9065a3b9e35f22ee061e71594cf335fd3791909032b8387f8ef567d4"},{"id":"0baf37ed-cf14-427f-b98f-cda28a1793d5","mime":"image/png","path":"assets/0baf37ed-cf14-427f-b98f-cda28a1793d5/image.png","role":"image","bytes":522111,"sha256":"985160f6949bf3725f098d471cb5f0fcbc81f138a1edbb3068cabaf5ef80271a"}],"rights":{"holder":"The Metropolitan Museum of Art, New York","licenseId":"CC0-1.0","ownership":"authorized-licensee","creditLine":"Paul Cézanne · Still Life with Apples and Pears · ca. 1891–92 · The Metropolitan Museum of Art, New York","permissions":{"export":true,"display":true,"download":true,"commercial":true}},"metadata":{"title":"Still Life with Apples and Pears","artist":"Paul Cézanne","medium":"Oil on canvas","language":"ko","description":"폴 세잔 · Still Life with Apples and Pears · 약 1891–1892 · 캔버스에 유채 · 44.8 × 58.7 cm · 메트로폴리탄 미술관, 61.101.3\n\n과일의 윤곽과 과일 사이의 빈 공간을 번갈아 보세요. 노란색·빨간색·녹색 면과 짙은 테두리가 둥근 과일을 드러내며, 뒤쪽의 접시와 벽은 깊이를 다르게 느끼게 합니다.\n\n나무 탁자 위에 노란색과 녹색의 배, 붉은색과 노란색의 사과가 놓여 있습니다. 뒤쪽에는 푸른 테두리의 흰 접시 두 개가 일부 보이고, 벽은 푸른 회색입니다. 탁자 앞면과 오른쪽 다리도 화면에 들어와 있습니다."},"revision":1,"createdAt":"2026-10-24T15:50:13.816Z","transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[0,0,0],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"dimensions":{"width":0.5870000000000001,"height":0.44799999999999995},"extensions":{"org.exhibitos.viewer/lod":{"version":1,"variants":[{"detail":"full","assetId":"2cce9da2-fcf7-43dd-888c-021da39f8b20","textureSize":2048},{"detail":"coarse","assetId":"0baf37ed-cf14-427f-b98f-cda28a1793d5","textureSize":512}]},"org.exhibitos.viewer/display-policy":{"profile":"approved-open-access-demo-v1","version":1,"approvalId":"49c304c9-e87c-5cab-add7-4801f3523d72","sourceAssetSha256":"1b58a2eb9065a3b9e35f22ee061e71594cf335fd3791909032b8387f8ef567d4","rightsEvidenceSha256":"d57bbb1cbcea8e5f2bcce7b81c48817780104e2ff1bce444db13f458b1ecee26"}},"provenance":{"events":[{"at":"2026-10-26T04:56:25.876Z","id":"1e74664e-dcdb-4140-bfe3-2e499a979dda","type":"exhibited","description":"Approved exact selected open-access display. Object https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/435883; raw SHA256 d4f072b4e2f9c458924e69a1f2f744b1ea242a34fd3f84ed6a5cd7fc9de521b4; canonical SHA256 1b58a2eb9065a3b9e35f22ee061e71594cf335fd3791909032b8387f8ef567d4; recipe SHA256 243a2b846b08922bbcd12cb8389c1cd5ef201aa6b05a9fdfce34b939c4b63a30; rights evidence SHA256 d57bbb1cbcea8e5f2bcce7b81c48817780104e2ff1bce444db13f458b1ecee26."}],"authorship":"human-authored"},"revisionId":"698ffd0e-d058-4905-b503-7e11b8ec3539","artworkType":"image","coordinates":"right-handed-y-up","schemaVersion":"1.0.0-draft.1","primaryAssetId":"2cce9da2-fcf7-43dd-888c-021da39f8b20"},{"id":"86b1baf6-206a-4fbe-9ae0-4e45df0639a3","kind":"artwork","units":"meter","assets":[{"id":"667c12bd-d362-4f59-8cf8-4f67c144adea","mime":"model/gltf-binary","path":"assets/667c12bd-d362-4f59-8cf8-4f67c144adea/model.glb","role":"model","bytes":1415084,"sha256":"13e430d0eb72d5e2a4ef0717e5f69d56ed3d0b76b0ee0e8d987d4e3d283f3bbe"}],"rights":{"holder":"Smithsonian American Art Museum","licenseId":"CC0-1.0","ownership":"authorized-licensee","creditLine":"Edmonia Lewis, Old Arrow Maker, modeled1866, marble, Smithsonian American Art Museum, Gift of Mr. and Mrs. Norman Robbins,1983.95.179; Smithsonian3D CC0.","permissions":{"export":true,"display":true,"download":true,"commercial":true}},"metadata":{"title":"Old Arrow Maker","artist":"Edmonia Lewis","medium":"marble","language":"ko","description":"에드모니아 루이스 · Old Arrow Maker · 1866년 모델 제작 · 대리석 · 기관 보고 치수 54.5 × 34.5 × 34.0 cm(기관 표기 순서) · 스미스소니언 미국미술관, 1983.95.179 · Norman Robbins 부부 기증\n\n대리석 작품을 디지털로 기록한 3D 모델입니다. 회화의 표면과 조각의 입체가 화면에서 각각 어떻게 드러나는지 비교해 보세요. ‘1866년 모델 제작’이라는 기관의 연대 표기와 실제 전시 파일의 디지털 변환 이력은 구분합니다.\n\n정면 화면에서 밝은 아이보리색의 두 인물이 낮은 타원형 받침 위에 나란히 앉아 있습니다. 화면 왼쪽 인물은 더 낮게 앉아 있고, 오른쪽 인물의 머리와 어깨는 그보다 높게 보입니다. 두 인물의 팔과 손은 몸 앞에 모여 있고, 옷의 주름이 무릎과 다리 주위로 이어집니다. 인물과 받침의 표면에는 밝고 어두운 부분이 섞여 보입니다.\n\n크기 안내: 기관 보고 높이는 0.545 m, 제공 모델의 Y 범위는 0.5419090075010902 m입니다. 모델 좌표와 방향은 원래대로 유지하며 물리적 크기·축을 독립적으로 보정하거나 측정한 결과가 아닙니다."},"revision":2,"createdAt":"2026-10-26T01:38:27.789Z","transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[0,0,0],"rotat